              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Stulyssa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I wasn't able to stay true to the recipe, but even with our substitutes, my boyfriend keeps making yummy noises, and claimed that this burger would sell if we opened a burger shack, haha. So it's a hit and we plan to make them again!",
