            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a wonderful and unique recipe that I couldn't wait to try. I didn't have any lemon grass, but my friend had lemon verbena and it worked perfectly. I also substituted red pepper flakes for the chili peppers and lean ground turkey for the beef. Honestly, the best turkey burgers I've ever made!",
            "datePublished": "2007-07-27T12:55:59.093Z"
