            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cabinkat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These burgers are good, but I really wouldn't compair them to \"Thai\". The lemon grass wasn't strong enough to give it that Thai flavor. (In order to get that taste you need vinegar). We followed the recipe exact and felt they were missing something nonetheless. My boyfriend added more onion and I added pepperjack cheese. All in all, if you want a burger with a different taste then these will do just fine.",
